halo-keyboard (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Establish the independent Yoga-Book Halo Keyboard project.
  * Rename the handler, service, configuration, and udev integration.
  * Provide a migration path from the touch-keyboard package.
  * Add the physically validated YB1-X91L Wacom orientation quirk.
  * Add deterministic project, udev, and hwdb validation.
  * Harden worker supervision, input resynchronization, and device lifetime.
  * Add focused configuration, option, multitouch, and uinput tests.
  * Decouple configuration lookup from the process working directory.
  * Restrict the systemd service to its required device-facing privileges.
  * Allow source-package generation without binary build dependencies.
  * Declare the systemd runtime required by udev service activation.

 -- Yoga Book maintainers <Yoga-Book@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 20 Aug 2026 14:30:00 +0200
